ouy ragné gni si bok.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3148,"row":{"en":"Thursday and bored already lol I'm married but looking for some excitement.","wo":"Alxamis laa dugg ci sëy, dama doon wut bànneex waaye mbir yaa ngi may tàmbali soof xaat, mdr.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAlkhamis la dougg si seuy, dama done wout baneh wayé mbir ya ngui may tambali soof khat, mdr.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3149,"row":{"en":"Once we were cleared to donate, we each sat down in a chair and had a needle inserted into our arms.","wo":"Biñu nee mën nanu maye, ku nekk toog ci benn toogukaay, ñu daal di lay jam puso ci loxo.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBignou né meun nagnou mayé, kou nek togue si bene toguekay, gnou daldi lay diam puso si lokho.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3150,"row":{"en":"I decided to put the project aside and try something else.","wo":"Ci laa mujjee teg lépp ci suuf, daal jublu ci leneen.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCi la mou dieu tegg lepp ci souf dal dioublou ci lénéne.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3151,"row":{"en":"Adaptability - flexible, agile mindset, optimistic approach;","wo":"Mëné fépp - yaatu, bari jom, njortu gu rafet;","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMene fépp - yaatou, bari djom, gnortou gou rafet;\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3152,"row":{"en":"And if she does get married, she may be more likely to be abused or mistreated by her husband.","wo":"Te su amee jëkkër, boo moytuwul ñu toraxal ko ci sëyam wala ñu koy metital.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTei sou amé dieukeur bo moytouwoul gnou torokhal ko thi seuyam wala gnou koy metital.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3153,"row":{"en":"You can use a pair of tweezers to grasp the tick as close to the skin as possible and pull it straight out.","wo":"Mën nga jëfandikoo keppukaayu kutt, nga kepp ko fu gëna jege der bi ngir dindi ko.","non_s