ANDARD>\nthi anam bou touti\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3160,"row":{"en":"We stayed up there for a while, just enjoying the moment.","wo":"Nu taxaw fa ab diir, di féexal sunu xol.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnou takhaw fa ab diir di fékhale souniou khol.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3161,"row":{"en":"In addition, acid rain can damage buildings and statues by corroding the materials they're made of.","wo":"Rax ci dolli, tawu asid yi mën na yàq tabax ndax doxam baaxul ci liñ defaree tabax bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nRak thi dolli tawou asid yi meun na yak tabakh ndakh dokham bakhoul si lign defaré tabakh bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3162,"row":{"en":"One day, Juan's mother decided to make him a special taco.","wo":"Benn bis, yaayam jël dogal ni dafay defaral Juan taco bu amul fenn.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBene biss yayam dieul dogal ni dafay defaral Juan taco bou amoul feun.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3163,"row":{"en":"If you are planning to rent a car for an extended period of time, you may be able to get a better deal by purchasing a rental car package.","wo":"Sudee dangay luwe oto ci diir bu xawa yàgg, li doon gëna xéewale ci yaw mooy nga jënd benn kofre buy def promo luwe oto.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSudé dangay loué auto thi diir bou khawa yague, li done geuna khéwalé thi yaw moy nga dieund benn coffret bouy def promo loué auto.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3164,"row":{"en":"Perhaps it is their strength, as they can carry us on their backs for miles.","wo":"Mën na am muy seen doole ndax mën nañu yab lu diis yóbbu ko fu sori.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeun na ame mouy seen dolé ndakh meun nagnou yab lou diss yobouko fou sori.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3165,"row":{"en":"They need someone to look up to, someone to represent the idea of the nation. The Blacksmith paused.","wo":"Dañu soxla ku leen di yéem, koo xamni ci moom lañuy xoole réew mi. Tëgg bi daal di noppi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDagnou sokhla kou len di yeem, ko khamni thi mom lagnouy khoole rewmi. Teugg bi daldi noppi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3166,"row":{"en":"Sudan's history is long and complex.","wo":"Taarixu Sudan gudd na te barina jaar-jaar.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTaarikhou soudan goud na té barina diar diar\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3167,"row":{"en":"Woman: I guess you're right.","wo":"Ku jigéen ki: Dëgg nga wax kay.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKou djiguéne ki deug nga wakh kay\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3168,"row":{"en":"criticism","wo":"Kiliyaan bi ma Sopp","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nkilian bi ma sopeuh\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3169,"row":{"en":"These aircraft were not as successful as their American counterparts, however, due to a number of technical problems.","wo":"Waaye waa Amerique ñoo leen gënoon baax ay roppalaan ndax dañu bariwoon ay jafe-jafe teknik.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé wa amerique gno léne geuneu wone bakh ay roppalaan ndakh daniou bariwone ay diafé diafé technique.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3170,"row":{"en":"Grandchild: I'm feeling really unmotivated.","wo":"Sët bi: Tay moom sawaru ma dara.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSet bi: Tay mom sawarouma dara.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3171,"row":{"en":"He ran as fast as he could, but the snake was gaining on him.","wo":"Mu daw lumu mën, waaye jaan jee ko gëna gaaw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou daw loumou meun wayé djane dji ko geuna gaw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3172,"row":{"en":"The fish, known as the rainbow mouth fish, is found only in a small area of the Pacific Ocean.","wo":"Jën woowu ñuy woowe jënu gémmiñu xonk, amul fudul ci barab yu ndaw ci Ocean Pacific.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDjeun wowou gnuy wowé djeunu guéminiou honk amoul foudoul thi barab you ndaw thi océan pacifik.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3173,"row":{"en":"It is made of milk and doesn’t contain any harmful substances, provided you consume an authentic product.","wo":"Meew lañu ko defaree te amul lenn luñu ci yokk lu mëna lore, lépp bëgg ngeen am produit bu raxul lenn.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMew lagnouko défaré té amoul lenn lougnou si yok lou meuna loré, lep beug ngen ame produit bou rakhoul lenn.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3174,"row":{"en":"Who is faster, the turtle or the butterfly?","wo":"Ku gëna gaaw, diggante mbonaat ak lëppaalëpp?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKou geuna gaw diguanté mbonate ak leupaleup ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3175,"row":{"en":"Grandmother: I remember when I was your age, we didn't have any of these fancy gadgets.","wo":"Maam ju gigéen ji: Maa ngi fàttaliku bimay am say at, xeeti aparey yii yépp amul woon.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMame djou guiguéne dji: Maa ngui fattalikou bimay ame saye ate, khéti apareye yii yeup amoul wone.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3176,"row":{"en":"When you dress well, it shows that you take pride in yourself.","wo":"Soo soloo bu baax, yaa ngi wane li danga fonk sa bopp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo soloo bou bakh yangui wané li danga fonk sa bopp.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3177,"row":{"en":"My participation in extracurricular activities such as student government and the debate team taught me how to communicate my ideas clearly and persuasively, and how to work as part of a team to achieve a common goal.","wo":"Lima daan bokk ci yeneen njàngale yu génn klaas, lu ci melni guwernmaa skoleer, ak ekip debat yi jàngal nañu ma nimay wara joxee sama xalaat ci anam wu leer buy yay nit, ak ni ñuy liggéeyandoo ak ñeneen ñoo bokkal mébet.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLima dane bok thi yenen niangalé you guenn classe, lou si melni gouvernemaa scoleur ak ekip debat yi diangal nagnou ma nimay wara diokhé sama khalat si anam wou leer bouy yay nitt ak ni gnuy ligueyando ak gneneen gno bokkal mébet.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3178,"row":{"en":"And you don’t need that rag to define you anymore.","wo":"Te soxlaatoo sagar boobu ngir wane ki nga doon.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nté sokhlato sagar bobou nguir wané ki nga done\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3179,"row":{"en":"In 2014, Compaoré was overthrown in a popular uprising, and Burkina Faso is currently in a fragile state of transition.","wo":"Ci 2014, réew mi jogal boppam jële fa Compaoré, moo tax jamono jii Burkina Faso nekk ci transisioŋ bu dese wóor.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCi 2014 rew mi diogal boppam dieulé fa compaoré motakh diamono dji Burkina Faso nekk ci transition bou dessé woor.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3180,"row":{"en":"Some people accused her of being exploitative and insensitive.","wo":"Ñenn ñi dafay profitoo ci mbir boole ci amul yëg-yëg.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnén gni dafay profito ci mbir boulé ci amoul yeug yeug.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3181,"row":{"en":"In the 19th century, Ethiopia was ruled by Emperor Tewodros II, who is considered one of the greatest Ethiopian rulers.","wo":"Ci xarnu 19, Buur bu mag bi tuddu Tewodros II, moo jiitewoon Ethiopie, ñu jàpp ni mooy bi gëna mag ci buur yi jiite Ethiopie.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nThi kharnou 19, Bour bou mag bi toudou Tewodros 2, mo djitéwone Ethiopie, gnou diap ni moy bi gueuna mag thi bour yi djité Ethiopie.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3182,"row":{"en":"There are many ways to achieve internal consistency.","wo":"Barina anam yu nit mëna jaar ba lépp leer ci boppam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBarina anam you nitt meuna diar ba leup leer thi boppam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3183,"row":{"en":"No matter which path you choose, it's important to find a reputable shop that you can trust.","wo":"Bépp yoon boo ci mëna jël, feexeel ba dem ci barab boo mëna wóolu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBeup yoon bo si meuna dieul fekheel ba dem si barab bo meuna woulou\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3184,"row":{"en":"He pulled her close and slapped her across the face.","wo":"Waa ji daaldi koy xëcc mu jege, mu fëgg ko mbej ci kanam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWa dji daldi koy heuth mou diegué mou feugue ko mbeuth si kanam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3185,"row":{"en":"He eagerly unpacked them and began to plant them in his garden.","wo":"Mu yàkkamti leen tekki, ba noppi tàmbali leen jëmbat ci jardeem.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou yakamti léne tekki ba noppi tambali léne dieumbat si jardeem.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3186,"row":{"en":"She told him that she loved it and that it had made her think about things in a new way.","wo":"Mu tontu ko ni neex nako te taxna mu jaare fa gisee àdduna ci beneen anam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou tontou ko ni nékh nako té takhna mou diarée fa guissé addouna thi beneen anamé\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3187,"row":{"en":"Every year, thousands of people are tricked, coerced, or kidnapped into giving up their organs.","wo":"At mu nekk ñu ngi nax ay nit, wala ñu leen jaay doole, wala ñu jàpp leen ngir ñu joxe seeni cër.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAt mou nek gnoungui nakh ay nitt wala gnou léne diay dolé wala gnou diap léne nguir gnou diokhé séni ceur.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3188,"row":{"en":"Call your mom, apologize for yesterday’s photo, and promise to burn that green rag in her honor.","wo":"Woowal sa yaye, nga jéggalu ci nataalu démb bi te waat ni dina taal rag bu wert bi ngir sargal ko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWoowale sa yayé nga djégalou si nataalou démb bi té waat ni dina taal rag bou wert bi nguir sargal ko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3189,"row":{"en":"In 1960, Southern Cameroons became independent from Britain, and it merged with French Cameroon to form the Federal Republic of Cameroon.","wo":"Ci 1960, Sud Cameroun daal di moom boppam ci Grande Bretagne, ba noppi mu boole boppam ci Cameroun Français ñu daal di nekk République Fédérale bu Cameroun.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCi 1960, Sud Cameroun daldi mom bopam ci Grande Bretagne, ba nopi mou boolé bopam ci Cameroun Français gnou daldi nek République Fédérale bou Cameroun.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3190,"row":{"en":"Mommy, what are those? the toddler asked, pointing at the plants in the living room.","wo":"Perantal daa joxoñ gàñcax yi saal bi daal di ni, Yaay, lii lan la?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nPerantal da diokhogn gancakh yi salle bi daldi ni yaay li lane la?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3191,"row":{"en":"Luxor is home to the Valley of the Kings, where many of the pharaohs of ancient Egypt were buried.","wo":"Luxor fala Vallé Buur yi nekk, foofu lañu suul pharaoh Egypt yu bari.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLuxor fala valé boure yi nekk, foofou lagnou soul pharaon egypt you bari.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3192,"row":{"en":"Ojinguh chomuchim is a sweet and spicy side dish made with fresh vegetables and blanched squid.","wo":"Ojinguh chomuchim plaat àndaale la bu neex te saf kaani ñu defaree ko legume yu fere ak kalmar buñ weexal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nOjinguh chomuchim plat andalé la bou nékh té saf kani gnou defaré ko légume you fré ak kalmar bougnou weukhal.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3193,"row":{"en":"Nowadays, hearing aids perform magic tricks such as filtering out background noise, so no more noisy air conditioner.","wo":"Leegi aparey yi ñuy jëfandikoo ngir dégg bu baax dañuy def lu am solo lu melni segg yenn bruit yi, leegi benn klim du leen tànxal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLegui aparey yi gnuy dieufandiko nguir degg bou bakh dagnouy def lou am solo lou melni segg yenn bruit yi, legui benn clim dou lén tankhalé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3194,"row":{"en":"While some of these mysteries may never be solved, they continue to fascinate us because they offer a glimpse into the unknown.","wo":"Doonte yenn ci kumpa yii dañuy wéy di umpu nit ñi, mingi wéy dinu gëna neex ndax daf ñuy dugalaale ci wàll wi kenn xamul.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDoonte yenn thi kumpa yii dagnouy way di umpu nitt gni mingui way dinou geuna nekh ndakh daf gnouy dougalalé thi wall wi kene khamoul\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3195,"row":{"en":"The bus, normally crowded, was stunningly nearly empty at this hour.","wo":"Bus bi woroon fees daanaka du am kenn ci waxtu wii ñu nekk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBus bi worone féss danaka dou ame kène ci wahtou wii gnou neuk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3196,"row":{"en":"She spent the night in a cave, and she survived by eating snow and drinking from a stream.","wo":"Ci lëmu doj la daan fanaan, di lekk neige, di naan ci ndox miy wal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nThi leumou dodj la dane fanaan di lekk neige di nane thi ndokh miy walé\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3197,"row":{"en":"When one person takes the law into their own hands, it sends a message to others that they can do the same.","wo":"Su nit demee ba tëye yoon ci loxoom, mingi wanaale ñeneen ñi ni ñoom itam mën nañu def luni mel.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSou nitt démé ba teuye yone si lokhoom mingui wanalé gnéneen gni ni gnom itam meun nagnou def lougnou mél.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3198,"row":{"en":"Only these are able to enable efficient and cost-effective production.","wo":"Yii kese ñoo mëna indi liggéey, muy liggéey bu baax te am xaalis.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYii kesse gnoko meuna indi liguey mouy liguey bou bakh té ame khaliss\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3199,"row":{"en":"There are a number of things that can cause acute inflammation, including infection, injury, and autoimmune diseases.","wo":"Barina mbir yu mëna waral inflamasioŋ bu meti, lu ci melni infeksioŋ, gaañ-gaañu, wala feebar buy imunise boppam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBarina mbir you meuna waral inflamasioŋ bou méti, lou thi melni infeksioŋ, gaagn-gaagnou, wala fébar bouy immunisé boppam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]}],"num_rows_total":3438,"num_rows_per_page":100,"partial":false}